  "body": "## Goal\n\nStep 1, PR F2 of the UI plan #4245, for #3025. After F1 (the Settings window), move the remaining per-user settings into it, as decided on #3025 (comment of 2026-11-28).\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Viewport / Graphics section:** add \"Show origin names\" (move from the browser pane, `browser_pane.rs`).\n- **Tools and import section:** \"Import tool holders\" (move from the Tool library page, #889).\n- **AI section:** \"Offline only\" (move from the AI Chat, #1945).\n- Remove each setting from its old place. Where a user looks for it in the old place, show a short hint or link \"in Settings\" if that place has room; else nothing.\n- Settings stay per-user and outside the undo history (#877). No MCP tool, no CLI flag.\n\n## Done means\n\n- Each moved setting works from the Settings window, keeps its stored value from older files, and is gone from its old place.\n- Tests for each moved setting and its persistence; the layout tests of the touched pages and of `layout_window_settings` updated. The `crates/ui` test count does not go down (#1953). No snapshot PNG changes.\n- Before and after screenshots.\n\nDepends on F1. Part of #3025 and #4245.\n",
